cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated research article and this repository."

title: "SENTICOL III — RNA-seq analysis"

type: software

repository-code: "https://github.com/melgani/senticol3-rnaseq"

abstract: >
R scripts used for RNA-seq analysis in the SENTICOL III GINECO trial,
associated with the study "Molecular alterations and relapse risk in
early-staged cervical cancer from the SENTICOL III GINECO trial."

keywords:

* cervical cancer
* RNA-seq
* transcriptomics
* differential expression
* limma
* voom
* SENTICOL III
* GINECO
* reproducible research

